    <item>
      <title>用 Workers 静态资源托管站点</title>
      <link>https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>不需要 Pages，也不用对象存储：把构建产物目录交给 Workers 的 assets 配置，一条命令发布成静态站点，并拿到 &lt;name&gt;.&lt;subdomain&gt;.workers.dev 地址。</description>
      <category>云原生与基础设施</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>Workers</category>
      <category>静态托管</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="margin:0 0 14px"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#0071e3;color:#ffffff;font:600 12px/1.7 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em">OpenRef OFFICIAL</span></p><nav class="feed-toc"><strong>本页内容</strong><ul><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/#适用场景">适用场景</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/#最小示例">最小示例</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/#说明">说明</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/#限制">限制</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/#下一步">下一步</a></li></ul></nav><div class="feed-content"><p>Workers 的静态资源（Static Assets）让单个 Worker 同时具备「文件托管」和「可编程」两种能力：命中路径时直接返回磁盘上的文件，未命中时交给 Worker 代码处理。一个项目即可发布整站，无需另建 Pages。</p>
<h2 id="适用场景">适用场景</h2>
<ul><li>想把静态站点发布到 <code>&lt;name&gt;.&lt;subdomain&gt;.workers.dev</code> 子域</li><li>静态页面为主，同时需要少量动态接口</li><li>不想维护 Pages 与 Worker 两个项目</li></ul>
<p>不适合：需要按分支预览、需要 Pages 内置构建流水线的场景。</p>
<h2 id="最小示例">最小示例</h2>
<p>配置 <code>wrangler.jsonc</code>：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="jsonc">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">jsonc</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line">{</span><span class="code-line">  <span class="tok-s">&quot;name&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-s">&quot;docs&quot;</span>,</span><span class="code-line">  <span class="tok-s">&quot;compatibility_date&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-s">&quot;2025-09-25&quot;</span>,</span><span class="code-line">  <span class="tok-s">&quot;assets&quot;</span>: {</span><span class="code-line">    <span class="tok-s">&quot;directory&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-s">&quot;./dist&quot;</span>,</span><span class="code-line">    <span class="tok-s">&quot;not_found_handling&quot;</span>: <span class="tok-s">&quot;404-page&quot;</span></span><span class="code-line">  }</span><span class="code-line">}</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<p>发布：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="bash">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">bash</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line">npx wrangler deploy</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<h2 id="说明">说明</h2>
<ul><li><code>name</code> 决定最终地址。账户子域为 <code>openref.workers.dev</code> 时，<code>&quot;name&quot;: &quot;docs&quot;</code> 得到 <code>https://docs.openref.workers.dev</code>。</li><li><code>assets.directory</code> 指向构建产物目录，Astro 默认为 <code>dist/</code>。</li><li><code>not_found_handling</code> 有两种取值：<code>&quot;404-page&quot;</code> 返回目录内已生成的 <code>404.html</code>；<code>&quot;single-page-application&quot;</code> 把所有未命中路径回退到 <code>index.html</code>，用于前端路由。</li><li>只配 <code>assets</code> 而不配 <code>main</code>，Wrangler 会部署为纯静态站点；之后需要接口时再加 <code>main</code>，静态文件仍然优先命中。</li></ul>
<h2 id="限制">限制</h2>
<ul><li>单个 Worker 打包后上限 10 MB（免费计划，压缩后）；静态资源不计入，但走同一份配置。</li><li><code>*.workers.dev</code> 子域由 Cloudflare 统一提供，策略可能调整；正式站点建议绑定自有域名，在「设置 → 触发器 → 自定义域」中添加。</li><li>绑定自有域要求该域名的 DNS 托管在 Cloudflare。</li></ul>
<h2 id="下一步">下一步</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/">D1 索引与查询成本</a></li><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/">KV 免费额度与写入策略</a></li></ul></div>]]></content:encoded>
      <openref:badge>official</openref:badge>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>D1 索引与查询成本</title>
      <link>https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>D1 按「扫描行数」计费而不是按请求数。缺索引的查询会把整表行数算进额度，本文说明如何建索引、如何写查询、以及免费额度的实际边界。</description>
      <category>云原生与基础设施</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>D1</category>
      <category>SQLite</category>
      <category>数据库</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="margin:0 0 14px"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#0071e3;color:#ffffff;font:600 12px/1.7 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em">OpenRef OFFICIAL</span></p><nav class="feed-toc"><strong>本页内容</strong><ul><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/#适用场景">适用场景</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/#最小示例">最小示例</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/#说明">说明</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/#限制">限制</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/#下一步">下一步</a></li></ul></nav><div class="feed-content"><p>D1 是运行在 Cloudflare 边缘的 SQLite 数据库。它的计费单位是<strong>扫描行数</strong>：一条 <code>SELECT</code> 实际读取了多少行，就计多少行。没有索引的查询会全表扫描，1 万行的表查一次即计 1 万行。</p>
<h2 id="适用场景">适用场景</h2>
<ul><li>文章、用户、配置等结构化数据</li><li>读多写少、单表规模在百万行以内</li><li>需要 SQL 语义但不想维护数据库实例</li></ul>
<p>不适合：高频写入（如计数器、实时日志），写入额度比读取额度小两个数量级。</p>
<h2 id="最小示例">最小示例</h2>
<p>建表同时建索引：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="sql">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">sql</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">CREATE</span> <span class="tok-k">TABLE</span> posts (</span><span class="code-line">  id INTEGER <span class="tok-k">PRIMARY</span> <span class="tok-k">KEY</span>,</span><span class="code-line">  slug TEXT <span class="tok-k">NOT</span> <span class="tok-k">NULL</span>,</span><span class="code-line">  status TEXT <span class="tok-k">NOT</span> <span class="tok-k">NULL</span>,</span><span class="code-line">  pub_date TEXT <span class="tok-k">NOT</span> <span class="tok-k">NULL</span></span><span class="code-line">);</span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">CREATE</span> <span class="tok-k">INDEX</span> idx_posts_status_date <span class="tok-k">ON</span> <span class="tok-f">posts</span>(status, pub_date);</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<p>查询必须使用参数化语句：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="js">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">js</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">const</span> { results } = <span class="tok-k">await</span> env.DB.<span class="tok-f">prepare</span>(</span><span class="code-line">  <span class="tok-s">'SELECT id, slug FROM posts WHERE status = ? ORDER BY pub_date DESC LIMIT 20'</span></span><span class="code-line">).<span class="tok-f">bind</span>(<span class="tok-s">'published'</span>).<span class="tok-f">all</span>();</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<p>批量写入用 <code>batch</code>，只计一次往返：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="js">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">js</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">await</span> env.DB.<span class="tok-f">batch</span>([</span><span class="code-line">  env.DB.<span class="tok-f">prepare</span>(<span class="tok-s">'INSERT INTO posts(slug, status, pub_date) VALUES(?, ?, ?)'</span>)</span><span class="code-line">    .<span class="tok-f">bind</span>(<span class="tok-s">'a'</span>, <span class="tok-s">'published'</span>, <span class="tok-s">'2026-10-24'</span>),</span><span class="code-line">  env.DB.<span class="tok-f">prepare</span>(<span class="tok-s">'UPDATE posts SET status = ? WHERE slug = ?'</span>)</span><span class="code-line">    .<span class="tok-f">bind</span>(<span class="tok-s">'draft'</span>, <span class="tok-s">'b'</span>),</span><span class="code-line">]);</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<h2 id="说明">说明</h2>
<ul><li>索引要覆盖 <code>WHERE</code> 与 <code>ORDER BY</code> 用到的列；<code>idx_posts_status_date</code> 同时满足筛选和排序，避免额外排序扫描。</li><li>用 <code>EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</code> 确认是否走索引，输出中出现 <code>SCAN</code> 即表示全表扫描。</li><li><code>bind()</code> 不只是防注入，也能让语句被复用，减少解析开销。</li><li>单行查询用 <code>.first('column')</code>，避免返回整行再用 JS 拆字段。</li></ul>
<h2 id="限制">限制</h2>
<ul><li>免费计划额度：5 GB 总存储，每天 500 万行读、10 万行写。额度按账户统计，非按库。</li><li>单条查询返回大小有限制，不要用 <code>SELECT *</code> 拉大字段。</li><li>数据库跟随区域部署，跨境访问延迟会上升。</li><li>没有连接概念，每次 <code>prepare</code> 都是一次独立执行；事务用 <code>batch</code> 或 <code>withSession</code>。</li></ul>
<h2 id="下一步">下一步</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/">KV 免费额度与写入策略</a></li><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/">用 Workers 静态资源托管站点</a></li></ul></div>]]></content:encoded>
      <openref:badge>official</openref:badge>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>KV 免费额度与写入策略</title>
      <link>https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>KV 的写入额度只有每天 1000 次，却常被当成数据库用。本文给出它的正确用途、记数替代方案，以及最终一致带来的读取陷阱。</description>
      <category>云原生与基础设施</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>Cloudflare</category>
      <category>KV</category>
      <category>缓存</category>
      <category>免费额度</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="margin:0 0 14px"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#0071e3;color:#ffffff;font:600 12px/1.7 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em">OpenRef OFFICIAL</span></p><nav class="feed-toc"><strong>本页内容</strong><ul><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/#适用场景">适用场景</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/#最小示例">最小示例</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/#说明">说明</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/#限制">限制</a></li><li><a href="https://openref.de5.net/docs/cloud/cloudflare/kv-free-limits/#下一步">下一步</a></li></ul></nav><div class="feed-content"><p>KV 是最终一致的键值存储：读取极快、全球可用，但写入昂贵且传播有延迟。免费计划每天 10 万次读、1000 次写、1 GB 存储。</p>
<h2 id="适用场景">适用场景</h2>
<ul><li>站点配置、开关、重定向表</li><li>渲染结果的缓存</li><li>会话、令牌等低频变更状态</li></ul>
<p>不适合：计数器、点赞数、实时排行榜——这类写入会立刻耗尽额度。</p>
<h2 id="最小示例">最小示例</h2>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="js">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">js</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-c">// 写入：带上 TTL，避免冷数据长期占位</span></span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">await</span> env.CACHE.<span class="tok-f">put</span>(<span class="tok-s">`post:${slug}`</span>, html, { expirationTtl: <span class="tok-n">3600</span> });</span><span class="code-line"></span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-c">// 读取：拿不到就回源重建</span></span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">const</span> cached = <span class="tok-k">await</span> env.CACHE.<span class="tok-k">get</span>(<span class="tok-s">`post:${slug}`</span>);</span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">if</span> (cached) <span class="tok-k">return</span> <span class="tok-k">new</span> <span class="tok-f">Response</span>(cached, { headers: { <span class="tok-s">'Content-Type'</span>: <span class="tok-s">'text/html'</span> } });</span><span class="code-line"></span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">const</span> html = <span class="tok-k">await</span> <span class="tok-f">render</span>(slug);</span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">await</span> env.CACHE.<span class="tok-f">put</span>(<span class="tok-s">`post:${slug}`</span>, html, { expirationTtl: <span class="tok-n">3600</span> });</span><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">return</span> <span class="tok-k">new</span> <span class="tok-f">Response</span>(html, { headers: { <span class="tok-s">'Content-Type'</span>: <span class="tok-s">'text/html'</span> } });</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<p>带过期时间的批量列举：</p>
<div class="code-block" data-lang="js">
  <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">js</span>
  <button class="code-copy" type="button" aria-label="复制代码">复制</button></div>
  <pre class="code" data-colored><code><span class="code-line"><span class="tok-k">const</span> list = <span class="tok-k">await</span> env.CACHE.<span class="tok-f">list</span>({ prefix: <span class="tok-s">'post:'</span>, limit: <span class="tok-n">100</span> });</span></code></pre>
  
</div>
<h2 id="说明">说明</h2>
<ul><li>键名用前缀分组（<code>post:</code>、<code>user:</code>），<code>list({ prefix })</code> 才能按组枚举。</li><li><code>expirationTtl</code> 单位为秒，<code>expiration</code> 接受绝对时间戳，二选一。</li><li>写入后在全球各点生效通常需要最多 60 秒；需要强一致的场景改用 D1。</li><li>值上限 25 MB，单个键的元数据上限 1024 字节。</li></ul>
<h2 id="限制">限制</h2>
<ul><li>写入额度远小于读取额度，<strong>不要把每个请求都变成一次写</strong>。</li><li>同一键的连续写入会互相覆盖，没有原子自增；计数改用 D1 或 Durable Objects。</li><li><code>list</code> 的结果顺序按字典序，不保证实时一致。</li></ul>
<h2 id="下一步">下一步</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/d1-index/">D1 索引与查询成本</a></li><li><a href="/docs/cloud/cloudflare/workers-static-assets/">用 Workers 静态资源托管站点</a></li></ul></div>]]></content:encoded>
      <openref:badge>official</openref:badge>
    </item>
  </channel>
